// The rivers, lakes, swamps and floodplains of the tropics (V2-10 (e)): Africa's hippopotamus,
// Nile crocodile, sitatunga, fish eagle, shoebill, tilapia and catfish; the Americas' capybara,
// caiman, anaconda, giant otter, marsh deer, jacana, piranha and arapaima; tropical Asia's water
// buffalo, mugger, gharial, smooth-coated otter, fishing cat, sarus crane and snakehead. Fish
// densities are per km² of water; the rest per km² of the land about it. The warm-blooded keep to
// where the winters are mild (`min_coldest_month_c`).
